{"publicId":"e1cea55a-7be9-4094-8887-f499955ead22","title":"Bitwise推出首款AI网络安全主动管理型ETF ZDAY纽交所上市","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T22:19:47.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-18T22:19:47.000Z","digest":"Bitwise于2026年11月17日在纽交所上市管理费率0.75%的主动管理型AI网络安全ETF ZDAY（NYSE代码：ZDAY），首批重仓股包括Palo Alto Networks（12.94%）、CrowdStrike（10.99%）等，且该ETF是Bitwise首个脱离加密货币赛道的金融产品【新】【旧】。\n\n该ETF要求至少80%资产配置于AI驱动的网络安全企业，首批持仓企业数量新旧报道存在分歧：旧报道称覆盖10-30家AI安全公司，而新报道显示持仓16只标的，但未明确总数【旧】【新】。\n\nZDAY的具体持仓比例显示，Palo Alto Networks以12.94%居首，CrowdStrike占10.99%，Okta占8.89%（数据来自2026-11-18 Crypto Briefing报道）【新】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-18T23:08:24.017Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Bitwise 推出首只AI网络安全ETF","latestReport":{"id":"qqsjsm35hfz06m3pdhx8q9akp"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":4,"newParticipants6h":1,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":false,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fLSFEGqFA8Rc","title":"Bitwise launches AI Cyber Defense ETF","firstReportAt":"2026-11-18T22:19:47.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"qqsjsm35hfz06m3pdhx8q9akp","title":"Bitwise 推出首只AI网络安全ETF","summary":"Bitwise宣布在NYSE Arca上市首只AI网络安全主题ETF，年费率0.75%，持仓16只标的，前两大持仓为Palo Alto Networks和CrowdStrike。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T22:19:47.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"qqsjsm35hfz06m3pdhx8q9akp","title":"Bitwise 推出首只AI网络安全ETF","summary":"Bitwise宣布在NYSE Arca上市首只AI网络安全主题ETF，年费率0.75%，持仓16只标的，前两大持仓为Palo Alto Networks和CrowdStrike。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T22:19:47.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T16:00:00.000Z","heat":18.9,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-17T17:00:00.000Z","heat":28.3,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","heat":27.5,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-17T19:00:00.000Z","heat":26.7,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-17T20:00:00.000Z","heat":25.9,"participants":3},{"hour":"2026-11-17T21:00:00.000